{"title":"Surviving with a SSS-Rank Inventory","synopsis":"“Suatu hari, aku menjadi ‘Storage Character’ dalam sebuah game!”\n\nSeorang gamer tanpa kehidupan dengan tujuh karakter level maksimalnya terjebak dalam game Virtual Reality (VR) dengan tingkat kesulitan tertinggi.\n\nSial baginya, dia harus terjebak saat ‘Storage Character’-nya mencapai level 10.\n\nIni mungkin awal yang buruk dalam kehidupan barunya, tapi setidaknya dia bisa merasa nyaman dengan banyaknya barang, kan?","alternative_title":"Surviving as an SSS-Class Alternate Character, 作为SSS级仓库角色生存","author":"Binjib, Glossam, Seok Hyo","artist":"Lee Jaeseok, Shin Jiksoo","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"5d28d385-d628-4848-8bc8-8f47df37fea4","number":"70","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2025-09-04","images":[]},{"id":"43b4975f-443d-4a7c-b44d-ec463ea45b1c","number":"69","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2025-09-04","images":[]},{"id":"c714385a-ef21-49bb-84fb-b180b6c86e02","number":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2025-09-04","images":[]},{"id":"63b17acf-4cb7-4e0e-81ed-5fa18242adf4","number":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2025-09-02","images":[]},{"id":"a6407380-6e1a-4b07-adf5-c9c766b05e95","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2025-09-02","images":[]},{"id":"f55d2cec-5c72-48a7-96b5-88c3a7ada08f","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2025-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"a085e6b2-cc91-4642-abd0-bdc2de9b0856","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2025-06-08","images":[]},{"id":"9219bf22-61ec-4a09-80ef-26a6195e035b","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2025-04-13","images":[]},{"id":"1afdaecc-f537-40b5-94f9-618517702f2b","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2025-04-12","images":[]},{"id":"ed64b7ee-d1de-4e67-933e-d20e26d5272b","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2025-03-30","images":[]},{"id":"ffba97b1-da71-42cb-a363-30164ff31ed1","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2025-03-29","images":[]},{"id":"8cc44a83-24fc-4610-810f-0b68fec8bc5b","number":"59","title"